# Copy this file to .Renviron (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit credentials, API keys, or service-account paths.
#
# The file is shipped without a leading dot on purpose: it stays visible in a
# listing and cannot be mistaken for the real .Renviron.

# --- reproducibility -------------------------------------------------------
# Pin string collation. LC_COLLATE drives sort()/order()/factor() level order.
# It differs from the system locale even for pure ASCII -- C sorts by code
# point ("Zebra" < "apple"), most system locales sort case-insensitively
# ("apple" < "Zebra") -- so an unpinned collation makes results depend on the
# machine.
#
# Setting it HERE rather than only in .Rprofile is what makes the pin hold.
# renv resets the locale on its way out of certain file parses
# (renv_parse_impl_native() calls a bare `Sys.setlocale()`, which resets LC_ALL
# to the environment default rather than restoring the saved value). When the
# environment says C, that reset lands on C and the pin survives; when it does
# not, the pin is silently undone. See .Rprofile for the fallback layer.
#
# Keep this line even if you add no secrets: it is the primary pin.
LC_COLLATE=C

# --- project ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact email used in the HTTP User-Agent for polite API access.
CONTACT_EMAIL={{CONTACT_EMAIL}}

# Example secrets (uncomment and set as needed):
# SOME_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/absolute/path/to/service-account.json
